General_SiSo_HWPTA_eCPRI_PTP_Failure
    [Documentation]
    ...  Test verifies whether after activating parameter 'actEcpriRuPtpOnlySync' to 'true' and setting parameter 'acceptedClockClass' to 7,
    ...  faults 'Unit synchronization failed' and 'ToP reference missing' are triggered on RMODs and SYNCs change their state to OutOfLock and Freerun respectively.
    ...  When parameters are set back to original values, alarms should clear and RMODs should return to Locked state.
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_dist_names}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                                hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                              connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${bts_name}=                                admin_info_model.get_bts_name_from_bts_info
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    Set test variable                           ${connection}
    Set test variable                           ${bts_type}
    Set test variable                           ${bts_name}
    config_operations.connect                   alias=${connection}

    IF  not $rmod_dist_names
        @{rmod_dist_names}=                     admin_info_model.get_rmods_distname
        ...                                     connection=${connection}
    END
    ${rmod_dist_names}=                         utilities.convert_to_list    ${rmod_dist_names}

    ${sync_sources_with_rmods}=                 Get Sync Sources with RMODs
    ...                                         rmod_dist_names=${rmod_dist_names}

    FOR  ${sync_dist_name}  ${rmod_dist_names}  IN  &{sync_sources_with_rmods}
        ${act_ecpri_ptp_initial}=               admin_info_model.get_parameters_by_class
        ...                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                     class_name=NRBTS
        ...                                     parameters=actEcpriRuPtpOnlySync
        ${act_ecpri_ptp_dist_name}=             Evaluate  next(iter($act_ecpri_ptp_initial))
        ${act_ecpri_ptp_recommissioning}=       Evaluate  {'${act_ecpri_ptp_dist_name}': {'actEcpriRuPtpOnlySync': 'true'}}

        Robot Log Operation                     Recommissioning parameter 'actEcpriRuPtpOnlySync' -> 'true'.
        config_operations.perform_parameters_recommissioning
        ...                                     parameters=${act_ecpri_ptp_recommissioning}
        ...                                     initial_parameters=${act_ecpri_ptp_initial}

        ${rmods_remained_online}=               Run Keyword And Return Status
        ...                                     Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure
        ...                                     120s    5s
        ...                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_rmods
        ...                                     ${connection}
        ...                                     online

        IF  not $rmods_remained_online
            Robot Log Operation                 Detected RMOD(s) reset after activating param 'actEcpriRuPtpOnlySync'.
            Wait Until Keyword Succeeds         10min  10s
            ...                                 Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
            ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
        END

        Verify Lock Sync States                 sync_dist_name=${sync_dist_name}
        ...                                     lock_state=Locked
        ...                                     sync_status=Locked

        ${topp_dist_with_accepted_clock_class}  admin_info_model.get_parameters_with_childrens_by_dist_name
        ...                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                     dist_name=${sync_dist_name}
        ...                                     parameters=acceptedClockClass
        ${topp_dist_name}=                      Evaluate  next(iter($topp_dist_with_accepted_clock_class))
        ${fault_trigger}=                       Evaluate  {'${topp_dist_name}': {'acceptedClockClass': ['7']}}
        
        Allow Alarms On RMODs                   rmod_dist_names=${rmod_dist_names}

        Robot Log Operation                     Triggering faults 'ToP reference missing' (fault_id=16) and 'Unit synchronization failed' (fault_id=4298).
        Robot Log Operation                     Recommissioning parameter 'acceptedClockClass' -> [7] on dist name: ${topp_dist_name}
        config_operations.perform_parameters_recommissioning
        ...                                     parameters=${fault_trigger}
        ...                                     initial_parameters=${topp_dist_with_accepted_clock_class}

        Robot Log Operation                     Waiting for alarms to become active on RMODs...
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds             5min  5s
        ...                                     Wait for Alarms On RMODs
        ...                                     rmod_dist_names=${rmod_dist_names}
        Robot Log Operation                     All required alarms are active on RMODs. Verifying lock and sync states...

        Verify Lock Sync States                 sync_dist_name=${sync_dist_name}
        ...                                     lock_state=OutOfLock
        ...                                     sync_status=Freerun
    END
    Robot Log Operation                         Test completed. Restoring configuration and verifying that all RMODs return to normal states and alarms are cleared.
    
    [Teardown]                                  eCPRI PTP Test Teardown


Get Sync Sources With RMODs
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_dist_names}
    ${rmods_with_sync_distn}=                   admin_info_model.get_rmod_sync_clock_dist_name
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         rmod_dist_names=${rmod_dist_names}

    ${sync_distn_with_rmods}=                   Create Dictionary
    FOR  ${rmod}  ${sync_distn}  IN             &{rmods_with_sync_distn}
        Evaluate                                $sync_distn_with_rmods.setdefault($sync_distn, []).append($rmod)
    END
    
    [Return]    ${sync_distn_with_rmods}


Verify Lock Sync States
    [Documentation]  Verifies that lock state and sync status are as expected.
    [Arguments]      ${sync_dist_name}
    ...              ${lock_state}
    ...              ${sync_status}

    ${params_to_fetch}=                         Create List    lockState    syncStatus
    ${distns_with_params}=                      admin_info_model.get_parameters_with_childrens_by_dist_name
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         dist_name=${sync_dist_name}
    ...                                         parameters=${params_to_fetch}

    ${dist_names_to_check}=                     Evaluate  {'TOPP_R', 'CLOCK_R'}
    FOR  ${distn}     ${params}                 IN  &{distns_with_params}
        IF       'TOPP_R' in '${distn}'
            Check Parameter State               dist_name=${distn}
            ...                                 param_name=lockState
            ...                                 actual_value=${params['lockState']}
            ...                                 expected_value=${lock_state}
            Evaluate                            $dist_names_to_check.discard('TOPP_R')
        ELSE IF  'CLOCK_R' in '${distn}'
            Check Parameter State               dist_name=${distn}
            ...                                 param_name=syncStatus
            ...                                 actual_value=${params['syncStatus']}
            ...                                 expected_value=${sync_status}
            Evaluate                            $dist_names_to_check.discard('CLOCK_R')
        ELSE
            Fail                                Distn ${distn} is unexpected. Only TOPP_R and CLOCK_R distns should be returned.
        END
    END

    IF  ${dist_names_to_check}
        Fail    Missing required dist names under ${sync_dist_name}: ${dist_names_to_check}. Found:\n${distns_with_params}
    END


Check Parameter State
    [Arguments]      ${dist_name}
    ...              ${param_name}
    ...              ${actual_value}
    ...              ${expected_value}
    Should Be Equal                             '${actual_value}'  '${expected_value}'
    ...                                         msg=Parameter '${param_name}', dist name: '${dist_name}' should be '${expected_value}' but is '${actual_value}'


Allow Alarms On RMODs
    [Documentation]  Allows alarms on RMODs before triggering the fault.
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_dist_names}
    
    FOR  ${rmod_dist_name}                      IN  @{rmod_dist_names}
        ${unit_path}=                           Set Variable  [${bts_name}] ${rmod_dist_name}
        Alarms.Allow Alarm                      alarm_id=7116
        ...                                     fault_id=16
        ...                                     fault_name=Unit synchronization failed
        ...                                     severity=Critical
        ...                                     unit_path=${unit_path}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
        Alarms.Allow Alarm                      alarm_id=7108
        ...                                     fault_id=4298
        ...                                     fault_name=ToP reference missing
        ...                                     severity=Major
        ...                                     unit_path=${unit_path}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END


Wait for Alarms On RMODs
    [Documentation]  Waits for 'Module unauthorized' and 'ToP reference missing' alarms to become active on RMODs.
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_dist_names}

    FOR  ${rmod_dist_name}                      IN  @{rmod_dist_names}
        ${unit_path}=                           Set Variable  [${bts_name}] ${rmod_dist_name}
        Alarms.Check if alarm is active         fault_id=16
        ...                                     fault_name=Unit synchronization failed
        ...                                     unit_path=${unit_path}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
        Alarms.Check if alarm is active         fault_id=4298
        ...                                     fault_name=ToP reference missing
        ...                                     unit_path=${unit_path}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END


eCPRI PTP Test Teardown
    [Documentation]  Restores configuration after test execution.

    config_operations.restore_configuration
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                 10min  30s
    ...                                         Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                       fault_id=16
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                       fault_id=4298
